{"id":"abebc662ad42f28a","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-readoncerecog.md","title":"Read-once witness and graph criterion","display":"thm-readoncerecog — Read-once witness and graph criterion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-readoncerecog","aliases":["27-thm-readoncerecog"],"display":"thm-readoncerecog — Read-once witness and graph criterion","depends_on":["[[27-df-readonceexpr]]","[[27-df-readoncefunc]]","[[27-thm-readoncegraph]]","[[27-thm-readoncepositive]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.5 Theorem 10.8; local witness and graph-criterion corollary","source_printed_pages":"467–470","source_pdf_pages":"491–494","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-local-corollary-reviewed-complexity-proof-not-independently-reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-readoncerecog"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-readoncerecog</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-readoncerecog — Read-once witness and graph criterion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b55c3b5cc4413e57\" href=\"?note=b55c3b5cc4413e57\" title=\"27-df-readonceexpr\">27-df-readonceexpr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abdabeb50455fed9\" href=\"?note=abdabeb50455fed9\" title=\"27-df-readoncefunc\">27-df-readoncefunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e475b6a12a44d89\" href=\"?note=6e475b6a12a44d89\" title=\"27-thm-readoncegraph\">27-thm-readoncegraph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f98fb2ec31a9f521\" href=\"?note=f98fb2ec31a9f521\" title=\"27-thm-readoncepositive\">27-thm-readoncepositive</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.5 Theorem 10.8; local witness and graph-criterion corollary"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"467–470"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"491–494"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-local-corollary-reviewed-complexity-proof-not-independently-reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_n,\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{occ}_i\">\\(\\mathrm{Eval}_n,\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{occ}_i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b55c3b5cc4413e57\" href=\"?note=b55c3b5cc4413e57\" title=\"27-df-readonceexpr\">27-df-readonceexpr</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"abdabeb50455fed9\" href=\"?note=abdabeb50455fed9\" title=\"27-df-readoncefunc\">27-df-readoncefunc</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(g),E(g),\\mathrm{Normal}_n,\\mathrm{P4Free}\">\\(V(g),E(g),\\mathrm{Normal}_n,\\mathrm{P4Free}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(g\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6e475b6a12a44d89\" href=\"?note=6e475b6a12a44d89\" title=\"27-thm-readoncegraph\">27-thm-readoncegraph</a> 的上游 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7f58350b3b48133a\" href=\"?note=7f58350b3b48133a\" title=\"27-df-cooccurrence\">27-df-cooccurrence</a>；正性接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f98fb2ec31a9f521\" href=\"?note=f98fb2ec31a9f521\" title=\"27-thm-readoncepositive\">27-thm-readoncepositive</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)=f\\land\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)\\leq1)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)=f\\land\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(\\mathrm{occ}_i(\\varphi)\\leq1)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\quad\n\\left(\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(g(x)\\neq g(y))\\right)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\left[g\\in\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(\\mathrm{P4Free}(V(g),E(g))\\land g\\in\\mathrm{Normal}_n\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\quad\n\\left(\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(g(x)\\neq g(y))\\right)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\left[g\\in\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(\\mathrm{P4Free}(V(g),E(g))\\land g\\in\\mathrm{Normal}_n\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>第一式保留一般带符号类的确切见证含义；第二式将识别判据扩充为原书 Theorem 10.6(v) 的图条件，由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6e475b6a12a44d89\" href=\"?note=6e475b6a12a44d89\" title=\"27-thm-readoncegraph\">27-thm-readoncegraph</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f98fb2ec31a9f521\" href=\"?note=f98fb2ec31a9f521\" title=\"27-thm-readoncepositive\">27-thm-readoncepositive</a> 推出。</li>\n<li>原书 §10.5 Theorem 10.8（印刷 p.467／PDF p.491）在输入为正函数完整 DNF（全体素蕴含项列表）、长度为文字出现总数时给出 GMR 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(n|f|)\">\\(O(n|f|)\\)</span> 识别及构造算法；本次核对该陈述及该页 Step 1、Step 2 分析，未逐行核验其后完整 Step 3 证明。此复杂性不适用于未经转换的任意 DNF，更不自动适用于带否定的一般公式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-readonceexpr","status":"resolved","id":"b55c3b5cc4413e57","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-readonceexpr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-readoncefunc","status":"resolved","id":"abdabeb50455fed9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-readoncefunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-readoncegraph","status":"resolved","id":"6e475b6a12a44d89","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-readoncegraph]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-readoncepositive","status":"resolved","id":"f98fb2ec31a9f521","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-readoncepositive]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-readonceexpr","status":"resolved","id":"b55c3b5cc4413e57","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{Eval}_n,\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n,\\mathrm{occ}_i$、$\\mathrm{ReadOnceFunc}_n,\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-readonceexpr]]、[[27-df-readoncefunc]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-readoncefunc","status":"resolved","id":"abdabeb50455fed9","anchor":"r